  (label "+3V3" (at 266.7000 172.7200 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "dec8ff1a-7852-49bf-9ae7-202b297ba772"))
  (text "HOW TO FOLLOW CONNECTIONS: each pin stub ends at a net label; identical labels are electrically connected. A0-A13: U1-U3; A0-A12 also U20. D0-D7: U1, U2, U3 and U20. Click a label in KiCad to highlight its full net." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 234 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "af4719c2-03f9-481c-9923-5c9d5c941c3e"))
  (text "CPU/VIA: A0-A15, D0-D7, RWB, RESET_N, IRQ_N. CPU PHI2 is an input; PHI2O drives the VIA clock." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 240 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b8242d1e-10ab-4fc5-bad4-85bcff3e9b77"))
  (text "SRAM: A0-A13 direct; U5 selects CPU A14 and fixed zeros or BANK_Q[3:0] for SRAM A14-A17. A18 is grounded, using half of this 512Kx8 candidate." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 246 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1a31ae12-5984-4552-9e54-10bb34280606"))
  (text "U7 resets the bank to zero; U6 holds or loads D0-D3 when BANK_REG_WRITE is true. U8 inverts PHI2O and RWB." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 252 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2c3c42ba-cdf3-4f15-8b21-cbfc8c749d05"))
  (text "U4/U9 decode address pages. Socketed DIP U10/U12 generate RAM select and PHI2-qualified active-low CE/OE/WE; OE and WE are mutually exclusive." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 258 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d6d45f31-117e-42b9-a773-fb88fc111003"))
  (text "Socketed DIP U15-U16 and U18 generate bank-window select, qualified bank-register writes and PHI2-qualified VIA CS1; VIA CS2_N is tied low." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 264 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "36bdc5b0-5618-4844-bc1c-cfda787f2c6a"))
  (text "Text screen: reserve SRAM $7800-$7FFF as a 25x80 row-major character buffer; ROM sends it to the Pico through the VIA. No character ROM or video hardware." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 270 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8f106b21-c211-4d11-9797-1d5b3d4cfc48"))
  (text "Power: J1 accepts externally regulated +3V3 only; no regulator is fitted. C19 is bulk bypass; C4-C18 are IC bypass capacitors." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 276 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7b0fd420-e81f-4913-a5a8-105ede021db3"))
  (text "Clock: 1.000MHz crystal with socketed 74HCU04 Pierce oscillator, series drive resistor and buffer. Verify crystal startup and CPU clock limits on hardware." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 282 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3f4da78c-fb05-4081-b024-ab1b3097d550"))
  (text "Reset: pull-up, 100nF power-on delay and pushbutton; CPU RDY/NMI/BE/SO and IRQ have defined pull-ups. Validate reset timing from the exact CPU datasheet." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 288 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cbfc01a7-b6f9-4d89-9134-078e549454e5"))
  (text "Pico is external: J2 pins 1-8 GP0-GP7, 9 REQ, 10 ACK, 11 DIR, 12 OE_N, 13-14 GND. Pico is separately USB-powered; provide common ground." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 294 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "af363a44-dd98-4f10-9f64-86304fb17f65"))
  (text "U19 SN74HC245N routes Pico A0-A7 to VIA B0-B7; DIR=BUS_DIR, OE_N=BUS_OE_N. Bus direction/output-enable reset defaults are passive." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 300 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d0e96ddc-2f14-4f60-bc10-a2c8da2ed218"))
  (text "U20 AT27LV256A: A0-A12 to CPU A0-A12; A13/A14 strapped low for an 8KiB image at $E000-$FFFF. /CE=PAGE_7_N; /OE=PHI2-qualified read." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 306 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4d0978ad-e326-4548-908c-1082f295694a"))
  (text "U20 is shown as a socketed DIP-28 3.3V OTP EPROM legacy candidate; confirm the genuine DIP orderable variant and availability before PCB. Program reset vector at $FFFC/$FFFD." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 312 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1f14116c-2884-4c19-acc4-fba78c9092a3"))
  (text "NOT fabrication-ready: exact EPROM package/sourcing, oscillator and reset timing, power budget/sequencing, Pico harness, BOM and board mechanics need review." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 318 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fbfdd706-cd01-4504-812b-8984b366d55f"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
